  "title": "Dancing in the rain",
  "caption": "I went to Union Square  this afternoon to work on a new little photographic idea I got (I'd call it \"conceptual art\" but it sounds a little too pompous ;)  As soon as I started shooting, I got attacked by some crazy guy calling me names who seemed to think that I wasn't allowed to take photos of Union Square because he happened to sit there.  About an hour later, I was done working on my idea, and the rain started pouring.  I still had my camera in hand when the people on today's photo spontaneously started posing for me.  A refreshing change after the nut case from earlier...  Thanks guys :)",
